    "name": "Practice Test (PT)",
    "text": "2\nPractice Test (PT)\n4 SECTIONS\nInstructions\n\nIn Self-Paced Mode, open each section of a full PT* in separate tabs in LawHub before you start.\n\nWe are opening up separate tabs so we do not have to press Complete Section to go to the next section.\n\nWe care about not pressing Complete Section because we want to Camo the PT, rather than having all the correct answers revealed to us at the end of the PT.\n\nDo not use Exam Mode.\n\nComplete section 1 and section 2 with no break in between.\n\nTake a 10 minute break between section 2 and section 3.\n\nComplete section 2 and section 3 with no break in between.\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
